-ga/main/cases/ga38_2010__stub_2009-16.md"}],"metadata":{"topics":["ecclesiastical polity","interim pastor status","stated supply pastors","presbytery authority","civil court jurisdiction","congregational consent","PCA non-hierarchical nature"],"standard_of_review":"not_reached","case_numbers":["2009-16"],"body":"SJC","synopsis":"The published Assembly record reports that Case 2009-16 was found administratively out of order. It does not identify the challenged action, type of proceeding, administrative defect, or any merits ruling or relief; the case therefore supports only that procedural status, not a substantive holding."}},{"id":"bco:25-10--case:cases/ga37_2009__2007-09_2007-10.md","record_id":"case:cases/ga37_2009__2007-09_2007-10.md","type":"Judicial case","title":"Lee v. Korean Eastern Presbytery (2007-09 & 2007-10)","year":2009,"disposition":"sustained","authority_weight":"high","url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-ga/cases/ga37_2009__2007-09_2007-10.html","raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/raymond-rishty/pca-ga/main/cases/ga37_2009__2007-09_2007-10.md","evidence_basis":"structured_case_metadata","relevance_status":"unreviewed","occurrences":[{"id":"bco:25-10--case:cases/ga37_2009__2007-09_2007-10.md:occ-caa9c61d5e53","url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-ga/cases/ga37_2009__2007-09_2007-10.html","repository_path":"cases/ga37_2009__2007-09_2007-10.md","locator":{},"excerpt":"","sources":["cases.jsonl:bco_cited_as","cases.jsonl:bco_cited_current","judicial_cases.jsonl:bco_provisions"],"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/raymond-rishty/pca-ga/main/cases/ga37_2009__2007-09_2007-10.md"}],"metadata":{"topics":["civil litigation by presbytery","stated supply","interim pastor","BCO 22-6 one-year limit","hierarchical vs. non-hierarchical denomination","pulpit commission","presbytery acting on behalf of session","civil court jurisdiction over ecclesiastical matters","PCA polity","non-hierarchical Presbyterianism","session autonomy","Korean Eastern Presbytery","congregational consent"],"standard_of_review":"not_stated","case_numbers":["2007-10"],"body":"SJC","synopsis":"The SJC sustained TE Eliot Lee's complaint against KEP for filing a civil lawsuit in New Jersey state court to adjudicate ecclesiastical matters (i.e., who was the rightful pastor of HKPC). The opinion affirms that PCA church courts have no authority to use civil courts to enforce ecclesiastical decisions, and that the PCA is a non-hierarchical denomination whose authority is moral and spiritual, not civil or coercive."}},{"id":"bco:25-10--case:cases/ga22_1994__1993-05.md","record_id":"case:cases/ga22_1994__1993-05.md","type":"Judicial case","title":"Clark v. Southwest Presbytery (Request for Clarification)","year":1995,"disposition":"administrative","authority_weight":"high","url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-ga/cases/ga22_1994__1993-05.html","raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/raymond-rishty/pca-ga/main/cases/ga22_1994__1993-05.md","evidence_basis":"structured_case_metadata","relevance_status":"unreviewed","occurrences":[{"id":"bco:25-10--case:cases/ga22_1994__1993-05.md:occ-dc11c48d416e","url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-ga/cases/ga22_1994__1993-05.html","repository_path":"cases/ga22_1994__1993-05.md","locator":{},"excerpt":"","sources":["cases.jsonl:bco_cited_as","cases.jsonl:bco_cited_current","judicial_cases.jsonl:bco_provisions"],"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/raymond-rishty/pca-ga/main/cases/ga22_1994__1993-05.md"}],"metadata":{"topics":["jurisdiction","church property","congregational withdrawal","civil corporation","ecclesiastical entity"],"standard_of_review":"not_stated","case_numbers":["1993-5"],"body":"SJC","synopsis":"John P. Clark, Jr. requested clarification of the SJC decision in Case 93-5 regarding who controls the assets of South Valley Presbyterian Church, Inc. after the congregation voted to withdraw from the PCA. The SJC held it lacked jurisdiction over the civil corporate entity and its property, declining to rule on Clark's request."}},{"id":"bco:25-10--overture:ga08_1980:13","record_id":"overture:ga08_1980:13","type":"Overture","title":"Revise the plans for the 1982 General Assembly","year":1980,"disposition":"Approved → sent to presbyteries; ratification not located","authority_weight":"medium","url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-ga/markdown/ga08_1980.html","raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/raymond-rishty/pca-ga/main/markdown/ga08_1980.md","evidence_basis":"title_subject_reference","relevance_status":"unreviewed","occurrences":[{"id":"bco:25-10--overture:ga08_1980:13:occ-6f1c59434edf","url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-ga/markdown/ga08_1980.html#ga08-p32","repository_path":"markdown/ga08_1980.md#ga08-p32","locator":{"fragment":"ga08-p32","page":32},"excerpt":"Revise the plans for the 1982 General Assembly","sources":[],"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/raymond-rishty/pca-ga/main/markdown/ga08_1980.md"}],"metadata":{"source":"the Session of Westminster Presbyterian Church, Fort Walton Beach, Florida"}}],"history":[]}
